-- `actuals_ledger_entry.seq` become `GENERATED BY DEFAULT AS IDENTITY`. EXPAND-ONLY (AD-19): the
-- columns keep their values, and a caller that still writes an explicit `seq` (the seed, with
-- OVERRIDING SYSTEM VALUE) still can. The `momo_next_*_seq()` allocators the caller used before
-- are no longer generated; a database that already has them keeps them, unused and harmless,
-- until a later contract step drops them.
